# Traffic light controller (Moore). Input: car waiting on the side road. Outputs: main green, side green.
# States G1/G2 are an equivalent pair (two copies of the main-green state) that minimisation merges.
fsm traffic moore inputs=1 outputs=2 reset=G1
G1 / 10
G2 / 10
Y1 / 00
S1 / 01
Y2 / 00
G1 0 -> G2
G1 1 -> Y1
G2 0 -> G1
G2 1 -> Y1
Y1 - -> S1
S1 0 -> Y2
S1 1 -> S1
Y2 - -> G1
